{"originalLanguage":"en","title":"Battle Cry","artist":"Beth Crowley","date":"2026-08-04","sourceId":"14524675:040","sourceHash":"eb720037f5223f5fb29a91100dd5402f7b9d82e984ed4b01551a3395f1aefeff","duration":257.48,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":18.37389902112,"end":22.634,"text":"I have no heart, just ice and stone","translation":"내게 심장은 없어 얼음과 돌뿐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":25.53451566896,"end":29.955,"text":"Made up of nails and teeth and bone","translation":"못과 이빨과 뼈로 만들어졌어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":32.375,"end":36.835,"text":"And I know exactly what I'm for","translation":"내가 무엇을 위해 있는지 정확히 알아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":39.7957437972,"end":44.036,"text":"To hurt and destroy and nothing more","translation":"상처 입히고 파괴하는 것 그뿐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":46.376,"end":51.216,"text":"And if it's true that I was made","translation":"내가 그렇게 만들어진 게 사실이라 해도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":53.50692455724,"end":58.377,"text":"I still don't know if I can change","translation":"내가 변할 수 있을지는 아직 몰라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":60.55753173144,"end":63.35777287864,"text":"But something has stirred","translation":"하지만 무언가 꿈틀거렸어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":63.35777287864,"end":65.378,"text":"A beast has awakened","translation":"짐승 하나가 깨어났어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":65.7979830212,"end":67.338,"text":"Opened a door","translation":"문 하나를 열었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":67.338,"end":69.798,"text":"There's no mistaking","translation":"틀림없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":69.798,"end":71.358,"text":"Waging a war","translation":"전쟁을 벌이며","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":71.358,"end":75.038,"text":"It's fighting inside of me","translation":"내 안에서 싸우고 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":76.6989217728,"end":81.539,"text":"So hear my battle cry","translation":"그러니 내 전투의 외침을 들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":81.799,"end":85.339,"text":"I'm out for blood to claim what's mine","translation":"내 것을 되찾으려 피를 보러 나섰어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":85.33966588416001,"end":89.12,"text":"Finally questioning","translation":"마침내 묻기 시작해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":89.6,"end":92.22,"text":"If I am my own worst","translation":"내 최악의 적이 나 자신인지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":92.22,"end":94.08,"text":"I am my own worst","translation":"내가 내 최악의 적","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":94.08,"end":97.06,"text":"I am my own worst enemy","translation":"내가 바로 내 최악의 적이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":99.8009112372,"end":105.201,"text":"I never thought that I could love","translation":"내가 사랑할 수 있으리라곤 생각도 못 했어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":107.96161400904,"end":112.182,"text":"Strangers at night were good enough","translation":"밤의 낯선 이들로도 충분했지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":114.422,"end":119.502,"text":"But love's not a thing you get to choose","translation":"하지만 사랑은 네가 고를 수 있는 게 아니야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":119.7026251048,"end":126.483,"text":"Try to resist, you'll always lose","translation":"저항해 봐도 언제나 지게 돼","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":128.563,"end":133.683,"text":"I made a deal to sell my soul","translation":"내 영혼을 파는 거래를 했어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":135.48398414152,"end":140.684,"text":"But lately, I have dared to hope","translation":"하지만 요즘은 감히 희망을 품었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":142.76461112424002,"end":145.66486088384002,"text":"That something has stirred","translation":"무언가 꿈틀거렸어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":145.66486088384002,"end":147.405,"text":"A beast has awakened","translation":"짐승 하나가 깨어났어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":147.405,"end":149.705,"text":"Opened a door","translation":"문 하나를 열었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":149.705,"end":151.745,"text":"There's no mistaking","translation":"틀림없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":151.745,"end":153.765,"text":"Waging a war","translation":"전쟁을 벌이며","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}